Maintainer: Christoph Sax <christoph@cynkra.com>
Description: Blocks for working with relational data in 'blockr.core'
    boards, built on the 'dm' package. Combine data frames into a data model,
    set primary and foreign keys, select, pull and flatten tables, and filter
    across linked tables with cascading through foreign keys. A crossfilter
    block shows linked counts for any column of any table and filters them
    in the browser.
